WEBVTT

00:11:00.197 --> 00:11:02.366
So what's your solution?

00:11:02.366 --> 00:11:04.743
What's your innovation?

00:11:04.785 --> 00:11:06.328
What are the next steps?

00:11:09.248 --> 00:11:11.041
Flooding has been an issue

00:11:11.083 --> 00:11:14.211
that we've faced
since our earliest societies.

00:11:14.253 --> 00:11:16.588
But for the first time,

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:20.634
we have the potential
for which we can find solutions.

00:11:21.844 --> 00:11:24.638
The damages, the cost, the lives lost.

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:26.432
We can change that.

00:11:27.266 --> 00:11:30.185
In our yards and our communities
and our cities,